    "description": "The Meeting Status Retrieval API provides a means to access the current status of scheduled meetings within the system. This endpoint returns detailed information regarding ongoing, upcoming, and past meetings, enabling efficient management and tracking. Ideal for applications that require real-time visibility into meeting dynamics, it can be utilized by organizational tools, reporting systems, and integration dashboards. Users can gain insights into meeting participation and outcomes, supporting better planning and resource allocation.",
